From c7d9fe8eb4f25f4c2d438f98af804a89a1305d8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:09:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: checkpoint before the comparefn call in inlined sort
 (1941d806d2, crbug 585624824)

V8 15.6 merge 1941d806d2 (cherry-pick of main 686ea5103e). The sort that
TurboFan inlines had no checkpoint before the comparefn call, so eager
deopts added while lowering the call resumed before the sort and re-ran
it after earlier comparefn calls had already had side effects. Add a
checkpoint with the snapshot continuation before the call.
